&lt;p>&lt;div class="vsa-container">&lt;img class="vsa-notation" src="https://orthodox-groningen.github.io/VSA-demo/vsa/praktijk-weekdagen-prokimena-weekdagen-block-1.svg" alt="VSA notatie" loading="lazy">&lt;/div>

